# ── Deliberate hold: personal / commercially-sensitive capability packs ──────
# `skills/` holds 34 packs. Some are personal or business-confidential
# (know-me, albert-dm, instantly-campaign, upwork, upwork-proposal, youtube-*).
# Held back from git until the owner decides what to publish — see the note in
# docs/decisions/ASSUMPTIONS.md discussion and ADR-005.
#
# The engineering packs (api-design, backend-engineering, code-review-standards,
# security, scalability, observability, docker, ci-cd-devops, frontend-*,
# software-architecture, playwright, skill-security-audit, …) are the ADR-005
# seed corpus and are safe to publish. To include only those, replace this
# blanket ignore with per-directory entries.
skills/

# ── Node / pnpm ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
node_modules/
.pnpm-store/
*.tsbuildinfo
dist/
build/
.turbo/
coverage/
.nyc_output/

# ── Next.js ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.next/
out/
next-env.d.ts

# ── Environment & secrets ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
secrets/

# ── Test & tooling output ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
playwright-report/
test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright/
evals/**/output/
*.log

# ── Infrastructure state ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.terraform/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
.tofu/
*.tfvars
!*.tfvars.example

# ── Editors & OS ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.recommended.json
.idea/
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
